    "description": "The published scripted baseline: a deterministic priority ladder that crafts what it can afford, chops the nearest known tree, walks to the best known ore it has the tier for, digs down the moment a level has nothing left it needs, and otherwise cuts straight branch-mining corridors on a three-row lattice. It never routes through lava and never walks back up a shaft. It is also the server-side fallback when an LLM seat times out twice."
   }
